  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 0.82,
      "end": 6.82,
      "text": "Nathan Adrian's 100 meter freestyle was fast, one of the fastest in Olympic history.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.19192,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.033051
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 7.82,
      "end": 9.82,
      "text": "But how fast is that?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.19192,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.033051
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 9.82,
      "end": 13.82,
      "text": "What if we were swimming not just against the other swimmers in London,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.19192,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.033051
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 14.82,
      "end": 18.82,
      "text": "but against every Olympic medalist ever in 100 meter freestyle?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.19192,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.033051
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 19.82,
      "end": 23.82,
      "text": "Here, we're gliding over 116 years of Olympic history.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.19192,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.033051
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 23.82,
      "end": 28.82,
      "text": "This enormous, historical pool contains some of swimming's biggest names,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.131637,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012428
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 28.82,
      "end": 41.05,
      "text": "from Ian Thorpe, to Mark Spitz, to Johnny Weissmuller.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.131637,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012428
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 41.05,
      "end": 46.54,
      "text": "And it takes us all the way back to Athens in 1896,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.131637,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012428
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 46.54,
      "end": 50.54,
      "text": "when a Hungarian named Alfred Hiosch won in a minute 22.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.131637,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012428
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 51.54,
      "end": 53.54,
      "text": "Here we've placed him in a modern pool,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.131637,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012428
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 53.54,
      "end": 56.54,
      "text": "but he actually swam in the cold waters of the Mediterranean Sea,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.131637,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012428
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 56.54,
      "end": 59.54,
      "text": "with hallowed out pumpkins for lane markers.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.131637,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012428
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 59.54,
      "end": 60.54,
      "text": "Seriously.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.131637,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012428
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 60.54,
      "end": 64.54,
      "text": "Back then, Hiosch was one of the fastest swimmers in the world.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.075745,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00141
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 64.54,
      "end": 67.54,
      "text": "But in a modern, down and back race,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.075745,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00141
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 67.54,
      "end": 69.54,
      "text": "when today's winner is wrapping up,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.075745,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00141
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 69.54,
      "end": 73.54,
      "text": "Alfred's more than 42 meters back, just over halfway done.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.075745,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00141
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 73.54,
      "end": 78.54,
      "text": "In 1924, Johnny Weissmuller was the first swimmer to break a minute.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.075745,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00141
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 78.54,
      "end": 80.54,
      "text": "Four years later, he won again.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.075745,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00141
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 80.54,
      "end": 83.54,
      "text": "But in this pool, they're still 20 meters back.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.075745,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00141
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 83.54,
      "end": 86.54,
      "text": "Why are these early athletes so far behind?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.075745,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00141
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 86.54,
      "end": 91.11,
      "text": "It's partly because of advances in technology and training.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.075745,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00141
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 91.11,
      "end": 94.11,
      "text": "Many of which came about during the Cold War.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081495,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001245
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 94.11,
      "end": 100.11,
      "text": "Starting in 1956, swimmers set records in eight of the next nine Olympics.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081495,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001245
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 100.11,
      "end": 104.11,
      "text": "The 55-second barrier fell in Tokyo in 64.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081495,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001245
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 104.11,
      "end": 108.11,
      "text": "Twelve years later, James Montgomery swam it in less than 50.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081495,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001245
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 109.11,
      "end": 112.11,
      "text": "And today's athletes are right around 47 seconds.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081495,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001245
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 112.11,
      "end": 114.11,
      "text": "They're chipping away at that next barrier,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081495,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001245
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 114.11,
      "end": 117.11,
      "text": "the 45-second mark that seems impossible.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081495,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001245
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 117.11,
      "end": 119.11,
      "text": "But is it?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081495,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001245
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 119.11,
      "end": 121.11,
      "text": "Here's one way to think about it.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.072656,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000216
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 121.11,
      "end": 127.11,
      "text": "Since the 1950s, these Olympians have gotten about one second faster every eight years.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.072656,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000216
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 127.11,
      "end": 130.11,
      "text": "If they continue at that rate, man, that's a big if.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.072656,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000216
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 130.11,
      "end": 134.11,
      "text": "A 45-second finish might happen in about 12 or 16 years,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.072656,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000216
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 134.11,
      "end": 136.11,
      "text": "say the games of 2024.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.072656,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000216
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 136.11,
      "end": 139.11,
      "text": "Obviously, it's impossible to know.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.072656,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000216
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 139.11,
      "end": 141.11,
      "text": "But if that barrier is ever broken,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.072656,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000216
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 141.11,
      "end": 144.11,
      "text": "today's athletes would be about five meters back.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.072656,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000216
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 144.11,
      "end": 148.11,
      "text": "No longer the best ever, just the best of their time.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.072656,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000216
    }
  ],
  "created_at": "2026-11-12T19:14:02+0800"
}
